{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember when RPGs were simple?<br>Click a skill. Watch the hit. Laugh when it misses. Panic when it crits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic turn-based adventure built with the spirit of old browser RPGs \u2014<br>bright worlds, bold effects, dramatic monsters, and party members who never shut up when things go wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What You\u2019ll Feel Playing</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That <strong>old-school excitement</strong> when a big skill lands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That <strong>oh-no moment</strong> when the enemy survives with 1 HP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That <strong>laugh-out-loud frustration</strong> when your party roasts you for messing up</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat That Feels Familiar</strong><br>Pick your moves, watch the effects pop, and learn the hard way that button-mashing still counts as strategy\u2026 sometimes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No random encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big skills, bigger consequences</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t win by grinding.<br>You win by <strong>not screwing up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/be7e702fbed77a40af0fe667dcb84eaa.poster.avif?t=1767505497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/be7e702fbed77a40af0fe667dcb84eaa.webm?t=1767505497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/be7e702fbed77a40af0fe667dcb84eaa.mp4?t=1767505497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Party With Personality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t play alone. You fight with a team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five party members. Five personalities. And they <i>will</i> comment on your mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some panic. Some stay calm. One of them knows this is a game \u2014 and hates it when you play badly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/b71d6cb5e65cf2d87adbc046d1401ab1.avif?t=1767505497\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bright Fantasy World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful maps, exaggerated monsters, and dramatic skill effects \u2014<br>built to feel playful, nostalgic, and just a little unhinged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/3d7cb6e86faca5dd9d81ed36a3b42017.avif?t=1767505497\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for players who miss this feeling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game isn\u2019t trying to be modern.<br>It\u2019s trying to remind you <strong>why you fell in love with RPGs in the first place.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever lost hours to a simple RPG that felt way better than it had any right to\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You already know why you\u2019re here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Friendly Warning (Seriously)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t try to 100% this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re not kidding.<br>Some achievements exist purely to test how stubborn you are.<br>They are not balanced.<br>They are not reasonable.<br>And <strong>normal humans are not meant to get them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was lovingly inspired by <i>Epic Battle Fantasy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, these are old memories retold from our perspective.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064560?t=1767505497","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064560?t=1767505497","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/0e0284866d44917be38d74ac87594e7149e1e7cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767505497","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/0e0284866d44917be38d74ac87594e7149e1e7cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767505497","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4151080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember when RPGs were simple?<br>Click a skill. Watch the hit. Laugh when it misses. Panic when it crits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic turn-based adventure built with the spirit of old browser RPGs \u2014<br>bright worlds, bold effects, dramatic monsters, and party members who never shut up when things go wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What You\u2019ll Feel Playing</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That <strong>old-school excitement</strong> when a big skill lands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That <strong>oh-no moment</strong> when the enemy survives with 1 HP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That <strong>laugh-out-loud frustration</strong> when your party roasts you for messing up</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat That Feels Familiar</strong><br>Pick your moves, watch the effects pop, and learn the hard way that button-mashing still counts as strategy\u2026 sometimes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No random encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big skills, bigger consequences</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t win by grinding.<br>You win by <strong>not screwing up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/be7e702fbed77a40af0fe667dcb84eaa.poster.avif?t=1767505497\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/be7e702fbed77a40af0fe667dcb84eaa.webm?t=1767505497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/be7e702fbed77a40af0fe667dcb84eaa.mp4?t=1767505497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Party With Personality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t play alone. You fight with a team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five party members. Five personalities. And they <i>will</i> comment on your mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some panic. Some stay calm. One of them knows this is a game \u2014 and hates it when you play badly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/b71d6cb5e65cf2d87adbc046d1401ab1.avif?t=1767505497\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bright Fantasy World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful maps, exaggerated monsters, and dramatic skill effects \u2014<br>built to feel playful, nostalgic, and just a little unhinged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/extras/3d7cb6e86faca5dd9d81ed36a3b42017.avif?t=1767505497\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for players who miss this feeling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game isn\u2019t trying to be modern.<br>It\u2019s trying to remind you <strong>why you fell in love with RPGs in the first place.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever lost hours to a simple RPG that felt way better than it had any right to\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You already know why you\u2019re here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Friendly Warning (Seriously)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t try to 100% this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re not kidding.<br>Some achievements exist purely to test how stubborn you are.<br>They are not balanced.<br>They are not reasonable.<br>And <strong>normal humans are not meant to get them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was lovingly inspired by <i>Epic Battle Fantasy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, these are old memories retold from our perspective.</p>","developers":["Novasypher"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064560/e7f4e5ed52c70823ddb8aaa2bc06f84be483